{"id":"n77893-2-5","stage":4,"title":"잔잔하다 · 恬淡","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77893-2-5-1","ko":"잔잔하던 집안에 이게 무슨 일이래?","zh":"家里本来这么安静，这到底是怎么回事啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잔잔하던","meaning":"恬淡，恬静","explanation":"잔잔하다：恬淡，恬静；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"잔잔하다","audio":"/audio/77f8545bb71e1d9a1053.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77893","senseId":"2","lemma":"잔잔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잔잔하던","audio":"/audio/956e784ece67839375b4.mp3"}},{"text":"집안에","meaning":"家庭","explanation":"집안：家庭；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집안","audio":"/audio/2474242906f4997ecb89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71361","senseId":"1","lemma":"집안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집안에","audio":"/audio/25ce6bbd643e75b02c5f.mp3"}},{"text":"이게","meaning":"这家伙","explanation":"이것：这家伙；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"3","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이게","audio":"/audio/080ef3b94e3a9d861970.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일이래?","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이래","audio":"/audio/fa39504965570cd7b0b4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"77f8545bb71e1d9a","term":"잔잔하다","zh":"恬淡，恬静","audio":"/audio/77f8545bb71e1d9a1053.mp3","entryId":"77893","definition":"氛围宁静平和。","pronunciation":["잔잔하다"]},{"id":"2474242906f4997e","term":"집안","zh":"家庭","audio":"/audio/2474242906f4997ecb89.mp3","entryId":"71361","definition":"以家人为成员生活的共同体；或指近亲。","pronunciation":["지반"]},{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这家伙","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"(贬称)这个人。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/eb38fd4cd3419401807d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77893-2-5-2","ko":"왜, 누가 아프시기라도 한 거야?","zh":"怎么了，难道是有人生病了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜,","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"아프시기라도","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프시기라도","audio":"/audio/26f33401a9ffc49c0373.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sourc